#10 719.7  Sofia-SIP is an open-source SIP User-Agent library, compliant
#10 719.7  with the IETF RFC3261 specification. It can be used as
#10 719.7  a building block for SIP client software for uses such as VoIP,
#10 719.7  IM, and many other real-time and person-to-person communication
#10 719.7  services.
#10 719.7  .
