#10 719.7  set of features for implementing SIP/SIMPLE User-Agents. Highlights
#10 719.7  include full UDP/TCP/TLS support, IPv4/6 support, SIMPLE presence
#10 719.7  and messaging support, SIP offer/answer engine and numerous
#10 719.7  mechanisms for NAT/FW traversal.
#10 719.7  .
#10 719.7  This package provides the main library runtime files.
#10 719.7 
