#10 740.3 Description: iLBC (internet Low Bitrate Codec) development libraries
#10 740.3  iLBC (internet Low Bitrate Codec) is a FREE speech
#10 740.3  codec suitable for robust voice communication over IP.
#10 740.3  The codec is designed for narrow band speech and results
#10 740.3  in a payload bit rate of 13.33 kbit/s with an encoding
#10 740.3  frame length of 30 ms and 15.20 kbps with an encoding
#10 740.3  length of 20 ms. The iLBC codec enables graceful speech
#10 740.3  quality degradation in the case of lost frames, which
#10 740.3  occurs in connection with lost or delayed IP packets.
#10 740.3 
