#10 740.3 Description: Sofia-SIP library runtime
#10 740.3  Sofia-SIP is an open-source SIP User-Agent library, compliant
#10 740.3  with the IETF RFC3261 specification. It can be used as
#10 740.3  a building block for SIP client software for uses such as VoIP,
#10 740.3  IM, and many other real-time and person-to-person communication
#10 740.3  services.
#10 740.3  .
#10 740.3  The library is implemented in ANSI C, and provides an extensive
#10 740.3  set of features for implementing SIP/SIMPLE User-Agents. Highlights
#10 740.3  include full UDP/TCP/TLS support, IPv4/6 support, SIMPLE presence
#10 740.3  and messaging support, SIP offer/answer engine and numerous
#10 740.3  mechanisms for NAT/FW traversal.
#10 740.3  .
#10 740.3  This package provides the main library runtime files.
#10 740.3 
