#10 740.3  Sofia-SIP is an open-source SIP User-Agent library, compliant
#10 740.3  with the IETF RFC3261 specification. It can be used as
#10 740.3  a building block for SIP client software for uses such as VoIP,
#10 740.3  IM, and many other real-time and person-to-person communication
#10 740.3  services.
